  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut sweet potato into wedges and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f20fa02f1a0679f029838/step-f77eb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop cucumber.\n• Place a large frying pan over high heat.\n• Cook corn until charred, 4-5 mins.\n• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Top with corn, cucumber and mixed salad leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f20fa02f1a0679f029838/step-1f5e47b4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut haloumi into 1cm slices and pat dry with paper towel. In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, BBQ spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the wedges have 5 mins remaining, return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f20fa02f1a0679f029838/step-6bf67d0d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Season salad and toss to combine.\n• Divide wedges, haloumi and salad between plates.\n• Serve with mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/621f20fa02f1a0679f029838/step-c4cc0060.jpg"
    }
  ]
